# ILLUSTRATIVE pre-brief: N = 49,000 = the registration's N = 30,000 final pairs x the DR3 candidate / final ratio 1.65 (10,231 / 6,210); on the day use the real count (the driver's --dump-candidates). Written by dr4_q1_estimate.py --n-pairs 49000.
