  rates from the two DR3 runs pooled (10,231 pairs, 5,315 queries, 228.5 MB accepted, 6.4 h): 0.519 queries, 22.3 KB accepted, 2.25 s per pair; the per-pair model is within 5 % of both DR3 runs
