  low      (density x1.00): about 25,455 queries, 1,094 MB accepted (1,337 MB received), 30.7 h serial (61.3 h if 2x slower, 122.6 h if 4x slower)
  central  (density x1.54): about 39,243 queries, 1,687 MB accepted (2,062 MB received), 47.3 h serial (94.5 h if 2x slower, 189.1 h if 4x slower)
  high     (density x2.50): about 63,639 queries, 2,736 MB accepted (3,343 MB received), 76.7 h serial (153.3 h if 2x slower, 306.6 h if 4x slower)
  suggested hard caps (1.5 x the central estimate, to be chosen by the owner): 2,540 MB accepted, 3,100 MB received, 58,900 queries
